 := wheelGraphData.chord_cover")), DescribeRole.Definition),
            Describe.Lean(DescribeId.Create("ambient-row"), DeclarationHandle.Create("D5/S3/Geometry/OriginalLabelTwoSum/PhysicalWheel.ambient_row"), H("ambient_row"), StatementSource.WithoutFormula(), AssessedProvenance.FromRepo(), Blocks(Paragraph(Text("D5.S3.Geometry.OriginalLabelTwoSum.Wheel.ambient_row. For each original c : Fin 4, the actual ambient path row is the finset image under f of the original wheel row. First identify the chosen tree path with wheelGraphData.path c by path uniqueness, then expand row filtering and use ambientEdge_image. This is an equality of original indexed rows.")), SourceText("Exact lexical source context (not a compiled telescope):\nnoncomputable section\nopen Set Finset SimpleGraph\nnamespace D5.S3.Geometry.OriginalLabelTwoSum.Wheel\nvariable {Ambient VL : Type*} [Fintype Ambient] [DecidableEq Ambient]\n\nlocal instance : OfNat wheelGraphData.chords 0 :=\n  inferInstanceAs (OfNat (Fin 4) 0)\n\nlocal instance (f : Label ↪ Ambient) : OfNat (ambientGraph f).chords 0 :=\n  inferInstanceAs (OfNat (Fin 4) 0)\n\nExact source statement (proof in the paired Lean module):\ntheorem ambient_row (f : Label ↪ Ambient) (c : Fin 4) :\n    (ambientGraph f).rows.row c = (wheelGraphData.rows.row c).image f")), DescribeRole.Theorem),
            Describe.Lean(DescribeId.Create("ambient-unique-interface"), DeclarationHandle.Create("D5/S3/Geometry/OriginalLabelTwoSum/PhysicalWheel.ambient_uniqueInterface"), H("ambient_uniqueInterface"), StatementSource.WithoutFormula(), AssessedProvenance.FromRepo(), Blocks(Paragraph(Text("D5.S3.Geometry.OriginalLabelTwoSum.Wheel.ambient_uniqueInterface. The actual ambient graph has local UniqueInterface at the original index 0 : Fin 4. Its chord starts and finishes are unchanged, so the proof consumes wheel_uniqueInterface directly. This concerns the selected physical fiber only.")), SourceText("Exact lexical source context (not a compiled telescope):\nnoncomputable section\nopen Set Finset SimpleGraph\nnamespace D5.S3.Geometry.OriginalLabelTwoSum.Wheel\nvariable {Ambient VL : Type*} [Fintype Ambient] [DecidableEq Ambient]\n\nlocal instance : OfNat wheelGraphData.chords 0 :=\n  inferInstanceAs (OfNat (Fin 4) 0)\n\nlocal instance (f : Label ↪ Ambient) : OfNat (ambientGraph f).chords 0 :=\n  inferInstanceAs (OfNat (Fin 4) 0)\n\nExact source statement (proof in the paired Lean module):\ntheorem ambient_uniqueInterface (f : Label ↪ Ambient) :\n    (ambientGraph f).UniqueInterface (0 : Fin 4)")), DescribeRole.Theorem),
