            Describe.Lean(DescribeId.Create("ambient-glue"), DeclarationHandle.Create("D5/S3/Geometry/OriginalLabelTwoSum/PhysicalWheel.ambientGlue"), H("ambientGlue"), StatementSource.WithoutFormula(), AssessedProvenance.FromRepo(), Blocks(Paragraph(Text("D5.S3.Geometry.OriginalLabelTwoSum.Wheel.ambientGlue. Given the original left GraphData, ground equation left.ground = insert e X, actual endpoint equation left.edge e = s(a,b), injective f with f 0 = e, e ∉ X and Disjoint X (Y.image f), construct PhysicalGlue with right = ambientGraph f and selected = 0. Right e-exclusion follows from zero_outside_ground; no parent graph/root is supplied by the caller.")), SourceText("Exact lexical source context (not a compiled telescope):\nnoncomputable section\nopen Set Finset SimpleGraph\nnamespace D5.S3.Geometry.OriginalLabelTwoSum.Wheel\nvariable {Ambient VL : Type*} [Fintype Ambient] [DecidableEq Ambient]\n\nlocal instance : OfNat wheelGraphData.chords 0 :=\n  inferInstanceAs (OfNat (Fin 4) 0)\n\nlocal instance (f : Label ↪ Ambient) : OfNat (ambientGraph f).chords 0 :=\n  inferInstanceAs (OfNat (Fin 4) 0)\n\nExact source definition:\ndef ambientGlue (left : GraphData VL Ambient) (X : Finset Ambient) (e : Ambient)\n    (a b : VL) (hleft : left.ground = insert e X) (hedge : left.edge e = s(a,b))\n    (f : Label ↪ Ambient) (hf0 : f 0 = e) (heX : e ∉ X)\n    (hXY : Disjoint X (Y.image f)) : PhysicalGlue VL Label Ambient where\n  left := left\n  right := ambientGraph f\n  selected := 0\n  X := X\n  Y := Y.image f\n  e := e\n  left_ground := hleft\n  right_ground := rfl\n  e_not_X := heX\n  e_not_Y := hf0 ▸ zero_outside_ground f\n  disjoint := hXY\n  aL := a\n  bL := b\n  edge_e := hedge")), DescribeRole.Definition),
            Describe.Lean(DescribeId.Create("ambient-actual-root"), DeclarationHandle.Create("D5/S3/Geometry/OriginalLabelTwoSum/PhysicalWheel.ambient_actual_root"), H("ambient_actual_root"), StatementSource.WithoutFormula(), AssessedProvenance.FromRepo(), Blocks(Paragraph(Text("D5.S3.Geometry.OriginalLabelTwoSum.Wheel.ambient_actual_root. For exactly the left data and hypotheses in the statement below, the actual glued graph root equals phi X (Y.image f) (Z.image f) (restrict X left.rows.root) (rawLink X e left.rows.root) (renameFamily f E). Apply the unrestricted PhysicalGlue.root_formula, use ambient_row and fundamental_rows 0 to identify the selected row with R.image f, use injectivity to identify its complement with Z.image f, and consume ambient_E_edge. X and the ambient label type remain original, including all ghosts outside the active union.")), SourceText("Exact lexical source context (not a compiled telescope):\nnoncomputable section\nopen Set Finset SimpleGraph\nnamespace D5.S3.Geometry.OriginalLabelTwoSum.Wheel\nvariable {Ambient VL : Type*} [Fintype Ambient] [DecidableEq Ambient]\n\nlocal instance : OfNat wheelGraphData.chords 0 :=\n  inferInstanceAs (OfNat (Fin 4) 0)\n\nlocal instance (f : Label ↪ Ambient) : OfNat (ambientGraph f).chords 0 :=\n  inferInstanceAs (OfNat (Fin 4) 0)\n\nExact source statement (proof in the paired Lean module):\ntheorem ambient_actual_root (left : GraphData VL Ambient) (X : Finset Ambient) (e : Ambient)\n    (a b : VL) (hleft : left.ground = insert e X) (hedge : left.edge e = s(a,b))\n    (f : Label ↪ Ambient) (hf0 : f 0 = e) (heX : e ∉ X)\n    (hXY : Disjoint X (Y.image f)) :\n    (ambientGlue left X e a b hleft hedge f hf0 heX hXY).data.rows.root =\n      phi X (Y.image f) (Z.image f) (restrict X left.rows.root)\n        (rawLink X e left.rows.root) (renameFamily f E)")), DescribeRole.Theorem),
